{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47324","headline":"苦春霖作寄友 · 吴筠","name":"苦春霖作寄友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"应龙迁南方，霪雨备江干。\n俯望失平陆，仰瞻隐崇峦。\n阴风敛暄气，残月凄已寒。\n时鸟戢好音，衆芳亦微残。\n万流注江湖，日夜增波澜。\n数君旷不接，悄然无与欢。\n对酒聊自娱，援琴爲谁弹。\n弹爲愁霖引，曲罢仍永叹。\n此叹因感物，谁能识其端。\n写怀寄同心，词极意未殚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}